WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
SubDuo — Turn watching time into learning time.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.128
Two languages, on screen at once. Pick any two from the site's own subtitles

3
00:00:07.128 --> 00:00:10.250
Read it, and hear it too. No more switching subtitles

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.138
Drag subtitles anywhere. Keep them off what you want to see

5
00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:14.633
Scroll to make text bigger. Each line sizes on its own

6
00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:18.250
Scroll back for smaller. Just the size you like

7
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.494
Learn it line by line. One key: next line, or hear it again

8
00:00:22.494 --> 00:00:27.750
Auto-pause at each line's end. Take your time to read

9
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.103
Alt + click any phrase. Double-click works too

10
00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:31.904
Meaning and context, right there. Check it without leaving the video

11
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:33.750
One click to save it.

12
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.100
Saved phrases go to Vocabulary. Phrase, meaning and subtitle, together

13
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.500
Review at growing intervals. Again and again until it sticks

14
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Turn watching time into learning time. Search “SubDuo” on the Chrome Web Store
